      "name": "Fear Aura",
      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "A PC who takes the spotlight within Very Close range of the Phantom must succeed on a Presence Reaction Roll (10) or mark a Stress."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lingering Haunt",
      "kind": "Reaction",
      "rulesText": "Countdown (1d6). When the Phantom is defeated, you can spend a Fear to activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC rolls with Fear. When it triggers, clear the Phantom’s HP and immediately spotlight them."
